            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[First release.

- Ejects your Time Machine backup disk automatically when a backup and its cleanup finish
- Shows the backup disk status in the menu bar: Backing Up with progress, Connected, Ejected or Not Connected
- Back Up Now mounts the ejected disk and starts a backup
- Launch at Login and automatic updates
- Universal app for Apple silicon and Intel Macs

Requires macOS 13 or later.
]]></description>
